lly sure how to incorporate the new products into my routine or if I should be using them morning, night, or both. \"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': \"Thank you for sharing this information! Based on your skin type and concerns, I'll provide you with personalized guidance on how to incorporate your new products into your routine.\\n\\n**Morning Routine:**\\n\\n1. Cleanse your face with a gentle cleanser suitable for combination skin. Look for a non-comedogenic and oil-free formula to avoid clogging pores.\\n2. Apply the Dr. Dennis Gross Skincare Alpha Beta Peel (1-2 pumps) to your face, avoiding the eye area. Gently massage it in for about 30 seconds to help exfoliate and unclog pores. Rinse with lukewarm water.\\n3. Pat dry your face and apply a few drops of the Sunday Riley Power Couple serum. This serum is formulated to help reduce the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, and hyperpigmentation. Gently massage it into your skin until absorbed.\\n4. Follow up with the La Mer Moisturizing Cream. This rich and luxurious moisturizer will help lock in the previous steps and provide long-lasting hydration. Apply a small amount to your face and neck, and gently massage it in until absorbed.\\n\\n**Nighttime Routine:**\\n\\n1. Cleanse your face with a gentle cleanser, just like in the morning.\\n2. Apply the Dr. Dennis Gross Skincare Alpha Beta Peel (1-2 pumps) to your face, avoiding the eye area. Gently massage it in for about 30 seconds to help exfoliate and unclog pores. Rinse with lukewarm water.\\n3. Pat dry your face and apply a few drops of the Sunday Riley Power Couple serum, just like in the morning.\\n4. Instead of the La Mer Moisturizing Cream, consider using a lightweight, oil-free moisturizer or a sleeping mask to help control oil production while you sleep.\n <Assistant> I have memorized the conversation and I will answer the question you ask."